 "
|   "

 "
|   <body {http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml}>
|     "

  "
|     <p {http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml}>
|       "PREREQUISITE: User agent needs to support scrollbars as the scrolling mechanism. If it does not, then this test case does not apply to this user agent."
|     "

  "
|     <p {http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml}>
|       "Test passes if there is a green square and "
|       <strong {http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml}>
|         "no red"
|       ". Such green square should not have scrollbar(s)."
|     "
